rred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T23:21:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T23:21:11Z","body":"The other difference is that official builds are made with MinGW GCC and LTO. Beta 2 might be when I upgraded build containers from Fedora 42 to 43 so we got a newer MinGW and GCC for Windows.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3730952569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733442848","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114803#issuecomment-3733442848","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114803","id":3733442848,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eh9Eg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T19:59:14Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T21:23:35Z","body":"I can reproduce the issue with the official Windows binaries on Wine on Linux with my AMD GPU, so it's not GPU/driver specific indeed but a problem with the binary itself. I'll do a test build with Fedora 42's mingw-gcc to see if that fixes it.\n\n*Edit:* Confirmed, building 4.6-beta3 with mingw-gcc 14.2.1 from Fedora 42 (instead of 15.2.1 from Fedora 43) fixes the regression.\n\nAlso tested with mingw-gcc 15.2.1 (Fedora 43) without LTO, and the bug still reproduces. So we're probably looking at a GCC bug and not one specific to LTO (for once).\n\n*Edit 2:* Some more testing with mingw-gcc 15.2.1, disabling optimizations (`optimize=none`) or setting it to `-O1` (`optimize=custom ccflags=-O1`) also solves the issue. So it starts with `-O2` optimization level (default for the editor in production builds).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733442848/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733571531","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114803#issuecomment-3733571531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114803","id":3733571531,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eicfL","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T21:26:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T21:26:46Z","body":"@BlueCube3310 @clayjohn Do you have pointers to what code is responsible for decoding this? Should I debug around `modules/hdr/image_loader_hdr.cpp`?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733571531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733580619","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114803#issuecomment-3733580619","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114803","id":3733580619,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eietL","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T21:36:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T21:36:57Z","body":"@akien-mga most likely the issue is in Basis Universal 3rd party code in this case. \n\nThe fact that the imported texture works fine in older versions points to the actual HDR import process working correctly and the issue being in the conversion from BasisU to GPU format ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733580619/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733599732","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114803#issuecomment-3733599732","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114803","id":3733599732,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eijX0","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T21:59:54Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T22:20:38Z","body":"~It appears to be an issue with either the patterns or indices~\nEdit: The indices get seemingly randomized.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733599732/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733613444","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114803#issuecomment-3733613444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114803","id":3733613444,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eimuE","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T22:12:54Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T22:12:54Z","body":"So I've been rubberducking a bit with ChatGPT and given the suspicion on Basis Universal, it suggested to try building with `-fno-strict-aliasing`.\n\nAnd indeed, looking at the Basis Universal source code, the header says:\n```\n// basisu.h\n// Copyright (C) 2019-2024 Binomial LLC. All Rights Reserved.\n// Important: If compiling with gcc, be sure strict aliasing is disabled: -fno-strict-aliasing\n```\n\nBuilding 4.6-beta3 with mingw-gcc 15.2.1 and `-fno-strict-aliasing` applied to `modules/basis_universal/SCsub`'s `env_thirdparty` seems to resolve this bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733613444/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]